OL,3,GNEWSAAir ambulance dispatched to
OL,4,ABelfast docks after vehicle overturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shipping company employee has been
OL,7,Ftaken to hospital following an incident
OL,8,Fin the Belfast docks.
OL,10,FThe Northern Ireland Ambulance Service
OL,11,F(NIAS) said an ambulance and an air
OL,12,Fambulance were tasked to the scene
OL,13,Fafter reports of an incident at 09:42
OL,14,FBST on Thursday.
OL,16,FThe shipping company Stena Line said
OL,17,Fthe incident involved an "overturned
OL,18,Fvehicle" and a member of staff, who
OL,19,Fsubsequently received medical
OL,20,Fattention.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
